[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":85},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"item",{"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":27,"_29":30,"_31":32,"_33":34,"_35":36,"_37":38,"_39":-5,"_40":-5,"_41":42,"_43":-5,"_44":45,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":36,"_53":54,"_55":-5,"_56":36,"_57":58},"expiresAt",1795912855000,"id","yubbhticb8czrw65r6fla2h4o","title","SolarWinds Serv-U 曝多项漏洞，涉及远程代码执行、提权与拒绝服务","originalTitle","Multiples vulnérabilités dans SolarWinds Serv-U (27 novembre 2026)","summary","CERT-FR 汇总披露 SolarWinds Serv-U 多项漏洞，部分可导致远程代码执行、权限提升和远程拒绝服务。","reason","source",{"_62":84},"links",{"_58":83},"publishedAt","2026-11-27T00:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt","2026-11-27T14:52:21.436Z","timelineAt","category","vuln","tags",[79,80,81,82],"score",50,"selected",false,"channel","news","story","x","readingMode","full","author","body",{"_75":-5,"_58":76,"_77":-5,"_78":36},"outline",[66,67],"relatedStories",[],"topics",[59,60],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original",{"_61":64,"_62":65},{"_61":30,"_62":63},"slug","name","漏洞披露","supply-chain","供应链安全",{"_11":73,"_69":74,"_71":72},{"_11":68,"_69":70,"_71":72},"sec-2","text","Solutions","level",2,"sec-1","Résumé","zh","<h2 id=\"sec-1\">Résumé</h2><p>De multiples vulnérabilités ont été découvertes dans SolarWinds Serv-U. Certaines d'entre elles permettent à un attaquant de provoquer une exécution de code arbitraire à distance, une élévation de privilèges et un déni de service à distance.</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">Solutions</h2><p>Se référer au bulletin de sécurité de l'éditeur pour l'obtention des correctifs (cf. section Documentation).</p><ul>\n          \n          \n            <li>\n              <p>Bulletin de sécurité SolarWinds cve-2026-123165 du 24 novembre 2026</p>\n              <a href=\"https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123165\">https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123165</a>\n            </li>\n          \n            <li>\n              <p>Bulletin de sécurité SolarWinds cve-2026-123166 du 24 novembre 2026</p>\n              <a href=\"https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123166\">https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123166</a>\n            </li>\n          \n            <li>\n              <p>Bulletin de sécurité SolarWinds cve-2026-123167 du 24 novembre 2026</p>\n              <a href=\"https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123167\">https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123167</a>\n            </li>\n          \n            <li>\n              <p>Bulletin de sécurité SolarWinds cve-2026-123168 du 24 novembre 2026</p>\n              <a href=\"https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123168\">https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123168</a>\n            </li>\n          \n            <li>\n              <p>Bulletin de sécurité SolarWinds cve-2026-123169 du 24 novembre 2026</p>\n              <a href=\"https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123169\">https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123169</a>\n            </li>\n          \n            <li>\n              <p>Bulletin de sécurité SolarWinds cve-2026-123170 du 24 novembre 2026</p>\n              <a href=\"https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123170\">https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123170</a>\n            </li>\n          \n            <li>\n              <p>Bulletin de sécurité SolarWinds cve-2026-123171 du 24 novembre 2026</p>\n              <a href=\"https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123171\">https://www.solarwinds.com/trust-center/security-advisories/cve-2026-123171</a>\n            </li>\n          \n            <li>\n      